---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About CalcBox — Free, Accurate & Private Online Calculators"
  description="Learn about CalcBox, our mission to make essential financial, mathematical, and health calculations effortless, private, and 100% free."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Our Mission</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">About CalcBox</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Building the web's cleanest, fastest, and most privacy-focused suite of daily calculation tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-indigo max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Why We Built CalcBox</h2>
        <p>
          We created CalcBox because most calculation websites on the internet are cluttered with aggressive pop-ups, slow-loading advertisements, confusing navigation, and mandatory user registrations. Simple tasks like estimating a monthly mortgage payment, checking a Body Mass Index (BMI), or calculating a percentage increase should not require navigating through dozens of banners or handing over your email address.
        </p>
        <p>
          CalcBox was engineered from the ground up as a fast, distraction-free utility. Whether you are a student solving algebra problems, a home buyer calculating mortgage installments, or a fitness enthusiast monitoring health statistics, our tools are built to deliver accurate numbers instantaneously.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold mb-4">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Instant Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Powered by modern web technology, every calculation happens directly on your device. There are zero server round-trips and zero loading lag.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 text-xl font-bold mb-4">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Absolute Privacy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Your numbers are your business. None of your loan amounts, personal weights, salaries, or calculations are ever transmitted or saved on our servers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-purple-600 text-xl font-bold mb-4">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Mathematical Accuracy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Every calculator is rigorously benchmarked against established financial and mathematical standards, including standard banking amortizations and World Health Organization formulas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">What We Offer</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-600">
          <li><strong>Personal Finance Calculators:</strong> Loan EMI Calculators, Compound Interest Estimators, Percentage and Discount tools to help you manage your budget and savings.</li>
          <li><strong>Health & Wellness Calculators:</strong> Body Mass Index (BMI) calculators and Age calculators to monitor essential personal health benchmarks.</li>
          <li><strong>Everyday Math & Measurement:</strong> Multi-category Unit Converters (length, weight, temperature, area) and Tip Splitters to simplify daily math.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-950">Have Suggestions or Need a Custom Calculator?</h2>
        <p class="text-indigo-800 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto">
          We are constantly adding new utility calculators based on user feedback. If there is a calculation tool you would like to see on CalcBox, we would love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-medium rounded-xl transition shadow-sm">
          Contact the Team
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
